  "question": {
    "text": "The graph between angle of deviation <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>&#948;</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math> and angle of incidence <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>i</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math> for a triangular prism is represented by :",
